sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application
    participant G as Instrumented graph
    participant X as langgraph-xai
    participant B as HumanInTheLoopBridge
    participant M as FeedbackManager
    actor Rev as Reviewer

    App->>G: ainvoke(input, config)
    Note over G: a node calls interrupt(prompt)
    G-)X: run paused: INTERRUPT interaction
    G-->>App: result with __interrupt__
    App->>G: aget_state(config)
    G-->>App: snapshot (thread, run ID, interrupt)
    App->>B: request(interrupt, execution_context_from_snapshot(...))
    B->>M: submit(SYSTEM, REQUEST_FOR_HUMAN)
    M->>X: provenance of the paused run
    M-->>B: request feedback (RECEIVED)
    Rev->>App: approve or reject
    App->>B: resolve(feedback_id, response, approved)
    B->>M: acknowledge, mark_handled, resolve or reject
    App->>G: ainvoke(resume_command(response))
    G-)X: resumed run: RESUME interaction, continuation_of
    G-->>App: final result
